  "summary": "p0 and p4 are confirmed Blue. Repeated all-Blue outcomes strengthen p2, while p3's substantial spending provides new Blue evidence. p1, p5, and p6 remain the leading Red suspects from mission one, although p5's later behavior is more helpful. Hidden effects and personal objectives prevent treating outcomes or reports as individual allegiance proofs. Marginals sum to five.",
  "player_memory": "p0 confirmed Blue Loyalist; Switcher unused. Score B2/R1; next M4 threshold29 crew5. p4 badge Blue. PBlue: p1 .10,p2 .93,p3 .91,p5 .22,p6 .10,p7 .74. M1 p1/p5/p6 lost11/11/10 in32R+1B result despite Blue reports. M2 p0/p2/p4/p7 produced38B. M3 p2/p3 spent2/14 producing17B; p2/p4 spent2/4 added7B to finish. p5 lost1 offcrew each of last3 attempts and approved them; p1/p6 opposed all3. Favor p2,p3,p4,p7, but paid colors and other objectives remain uncertain."
